sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant App as POS App
    participant Repo as Payment Repository
    participant DB as Encrypted Local Storage
    participant SDK as POS SDK
    participant GW as Payment Gateway
    User ->> App: Retry payment
    App ->> Repo: retryPayment(intentId)
    Repo ->> DB: Load PaymentIntent(intentId)
    DB -->> Repo: intent(amount, idempotencyKey, status=PENDING)

    alt Safe to retry without re-reading card
        Note right of Repo: High confidence request was not sent<br>based on technical signals<br>nand token still valid
        Repo ->> GW: retry charge(same idempotencyKey, same token)

    else Card re-presentation required
        Note right of Repo: Note right of Repo: Outcome uncertain or token expired<br>EMV compliance requires re-presentation
        Repo ->> SDK: Read card again
        SDK -->> Repo: New payment token
        Repo ->> GW: Retry charge(same idempotencyKey, new token)
    end

    alt Gateway already processed
        GW -->> Repo: Success(transactionId)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (COMPLETED, transactionId)
        Repo -->> App: Payment success

    else Gateway processes now
        GW -->> Repo: Success(transactionId)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (COMPLETED, transactionId)
        Repo -->> App: Payment success

    else Retryable failure
        GW -->> Repo: Failed(retryable)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (PENDING, lastError=retryable)
        Repo -->> App: Retry allowed

    else Non-retryable failure
        GW -->> Repo: Failed(errorCode)
        Repo ->> DB: Update intent (FAILED)
        Repo -->> App: Payment failed
    end
